    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ac80423667aaa53f00ca6e2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "保险起见，我本想带她去看看大夫的……\n但是神业的解说仍在滔滔不绝。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8797b5fa2c893365660c6adbb9377be8af8ccf9f71a7a014876268538fbdc9dc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
