    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17fc5209838900cfa9609891",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是的。因为需要精神集中到脚尖，\n在适应之前大脑和身体都需要全速运转……\n可能会像刚才那样晕倒吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "97b9873b4a81b1b70e97dffb716c38b018ceaed2184e8ef1b3d03885c1c833bf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
