      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而且还有虽说不上完全是弊端\n……跑法最好固定成“差行”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea841494370b5caf9452bc41b28b546b9af12667171d6e3535ae52d7eb55601f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
