    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9e1c322a334bb21c970c8a9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是的。因为这种跑法一旦开始冲刺，\n就无法停止加速。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8d7b5d3396c8e7f2f978685c97e033a0c3f9df20f19734f8732573a76cbb078",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
