      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是这种跑法\n一定会让大家兴奋不已！\n这是能迈向世界的跑法啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed77d9aba1d14cae079329eb2a8fbc8c08c0fb333b7e416358dedf977105f701",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
