    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed5735600f82af3ff56abbb0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "的确，在比拼耐力的『菊花赏』中，\n若真有赛马娘能以如此理想的跑法取胜，\n人们一定会为之沸腾吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "504b06863f2595e12113a887d6f5122166c2e5ef2474feca0099f799820023d2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
